<title>USA: Martinez USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Martinez USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica said it won $8.250 million of Martinez USD, Calif., general obligation bonds, Election of 1995, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.70 percent.</p>
</text>
